          <mxGeometry x="40" y="25" width="1120" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="A candidate request is not a successful build, deployment or CMS publication receipt." style="text;html=0;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;fontColor=#43566B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="78" width="1120" height="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b1" value="01  Owner confirmation&#10;&#10;Releases → Delivery and recovery&#10;Astro candidate builds&#10;Responsive light/dark screen&#10;Safe status + request reference" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b2" value="02  Authenticated Go API&#10;&#10;Owner-only GET / POST&#10;Existing session + CSRF checks&#10;Only caller input: attempt UUID&#10;Frozen approval supplies content IDs" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b3" value="03  Durable admission&#10;&#10;Workspace + current Owner fence&#10;Active source / pending Astro job&#10;Append-only claim; lifetime limit 3&#10;Commit before network I/O" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b4" value="04  Fixed GitHub client&#10;&#10;Repository / workflow / branch checks&#10;Exact reviewed consumer-code SHA&#10;One POST; fixed api.github.com&#10;No redirects / proxy / URL following" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b5" value="05  Fenced outcome + audit&#10;&#10;Repeat Owner/source/target/lease&#10;Accepted: retain positive run ID&#10;Rejected: proved zero POSTs&#10;Unknown: retain uncertainty" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
