  <diagram id="astro-candidate-2" name="02 — Durable state and retry safety">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="760" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1200" pageHeight="760">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="title" value="02 — Durable state and retry safety" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#142B3A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="25" width="1120" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="Network and SQL cannot share a transaction. Lost acknowledgement must not create another dispatch." style="text;html=0;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;fontColor=#43566B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="78" width="1120" height="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b1" value="01  Permanent claim&#10;&#10;UUID unique across delivery ledgers&#10;Monotonic ordinal orders admissions&#10;30-second lease; no TTL reset&#10;Actor + immutable target incarnation" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b2" value="02  Fixed preflight&#10;&#10;Failure: rejected, zero POST sent&#10;Fresh UUID only within budget 3&#10;Corrected settings may be retried&#10;Success: proceed to one POST" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b3" value="03  Exactly one dispatch POST&#10;&#10;Six public identity/correlation inputs&#10;HTTP 200 + exact positive run ID&#10;Bounded bytes and 14-second budget&#10;Any ambiguous POST → uncertain" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b4" value="04  Accepted&#10;&#10;Exact same UUID replays locally&#10;No new POST or fresh attempt&#10;Run ID is correlation, not success&#10;No artifact or deployment certified" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b5" value="05  Uncertain / expired claim&#10;&#10;May already have created a run&#10;Refresh status; no fresh dispatch&#10;Rotation does not erase history&#10;No reconciliation control yet" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b6" value="06  Future observation gate&#10;&#10;Independently inspect run metadata&#10;Reconcile retained exact attempt&#10;Verify artifact and deployed output&#10;Only then add fenced Astro receipt" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="footer" value="M5k · 7 November 2026 · Migration 00022 · Optional provider disabled by default · Astro publication stays pending" style="text;html=0;align=left;fontSize=14;fontColor=#43566B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
