        <mxCell id="b2" value="02  Admin + consumer evidence&#10;&#10;188 Flutter tests; analysis clean&#10;94.39% executable Dart coverage&#10;25 Astro unit / 12 repository tests&#10;Exact code guard before checkout" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b3" value="03  Credential boundary&#10;&#10;API token: repository Actions write&#10;Broader than one workflow allowlist&#10;Protect code + deployment approvals&#10;Candidate runtime: contents read" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b4" value="04  Safe diagnostics&#10;&#10;Constant structured event names&#10;Safe actor/release/attempt identifiers&#10;No raw provider body / token logs&#10;Immutable outcome + audit transaction" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b5" value="05  Local verification limits&#10;&#10;No live dispatch or Pages deploy&#10;No editing DB migration applied&#10;No new Linux race / device run&#10;One uncalled module advisory retained" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b6" value="06  Next implementation gates&#10;&#10;Run observation + reconciliation&#10;Exact artifact + independent Go proof&#10;Verified deployed provenance&#10;Atomic attempt-fenced Astro receipt" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
